{"id": "1647092", "name": "לכסון מטריצה סימטרית 3X3 עם ע\"ע כפול", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "countZeros", "params": ["A"], "body": "block(zeros:0, for row in A do (for x in row do (if x=0 then zeros:zeros+1)), zeros)"}, {"name": "listOfRowsToMatrix", "params": ["L"], "body": "apply(addrow,map(matrix,L))"}, {"name": "orthonormalMatrix", "params": ["n"], "body": "block(\nP: genmatrix (matrixEntry, n, n).transpose(genmatrix (matrixEntry, n, n)),\nP:gramschmidt(P),\nP: map(lambda([row], (1/sqrt(row.transpose(row))).row),P),\ngs_mat:transpose(listOfRowsToMatrix(P)),\ngs_mat:ratsimp(gs_mat))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה המטריצה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A = {{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>נסמן ב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\)</span> את קבוצת הערכים העצמיים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>. מצאו אותה</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(S=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p>(היעזרו בפולינום האופייני).</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: קבוצה מסמנים בעזרת סוגריים מסולסלים <code dir=\"ltr\">{}</code> כאשר האיברים של הקבוצה נפרדים בפסיקים. התבנית המופיעה <strong>אינה</strong> רומזת על מספר הערכים העצמיים. במידה ויש צורך - הוסיפו/הורידו ערכים.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>מצאו מטריצה הפיכה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> ומטריצה אלכסונית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> המקיימות כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P^tAP=D\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(P=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(D=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הדרך להזנת כפל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a*b</code>. הדרך להזנת חזקה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a^b</code>. הדרך להזנת שבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a/b</code>. הדרך להזנת שורש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(a)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{?,?}", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 60, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([?,?,?],[?,?,?],[?,?,?])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([?,?,?],[?,?,?],[?,?,?])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "eigValset", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה שגויה</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "isInvertable: is(rref(ans2)=ident(n));\nisDiag:true;\nfor i:1 thru n do (for j:1 thru n do (if i#j and ans3[i][j]#0 then isDiag:false));\ncorrect: if isInvertable and isDiag and is(equal((transpose(ans2).mat_A.ans2) ,ans3)) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה שגויה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["P", "diag_mat", "eig1", "eig2", "eigValset", "gs_mat", "mat_A", "matrixEntry", "n", "zeros"], "nvariants": 50}